  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the circumcircle of the square formed by the lines <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is",
