  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation of lines are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7581406a-3d08-49d5-a083-a65ea071261f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.89375in;height:1.48681in\" /><br />Circle with segment joining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6,9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> as the diameter is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
